Module twoways "A tower with two ways in" {
  Place grounds "the grounds" is settlement.
  Place yard "the yard" is room within grounds at 0, 0.
  Place garden "the garden" is room within grounds at 1, 0.
  Place tower "the tower" is building within grounds.
  Place hall "the tower hall" is room within tower at 0, 0.
  Place cellar "the tower cellar" is room within tower at 1, 0.
  Place hut "the hut" is building within grounds.
  Place hut_room "the hut's one room" is room within hut at 0, 0.
  Company party "You" of 1 at yard.
  Passage walk "the garden path" is path between yard and garden.
  // The tower is entered two ways, from two places: each is told by its own name.
  Passage door "the door" is door between yard and hall.
  Passage shaft "the old well-shaft" is passage between garden and cellar.
  Passage inside "the inner stair" is passage between hall and cellar.
  // The hut has one door, and is entered by it without saying so.
  Passage hut_door "the hut door" is door between yard and hut_room.
  Observe yard_scene at yard when true "A yard before a tower.".
}
